Questions, comments, confusions?

Artifacts limited by altar:

    * You can no longer get as many artifacts as you want from an altar.
    * 20% chance after each artifact that you can continue to get more.
    * No message if that's the last one.
    * After that, 1/3 chance every time that you would have gotten an
      artifact that your god will berate you verbally.

Better messages:

    * If you get killed with a monster wielding an artifact weapon it 
      now tells you.  
    * This may make the death messages too long (is there a too long?)
        - Maybe it should just say "killed by Frost Brand" not 
	  "killed by an invisible hallucinogen-distorted water 
	  troll wielding Frost Brand".

Taking back artifacts:

    * Now, if you are bad, your god will try to take back artifacts from you.
    * Converting altars, killing priests, killing quest leaders or guardians,
      trying to convert the high altar, or murdering as a lawful will all
      piss off some god (maybe not yours!)
    * Gods will only take back artifacts of their own alignment, and will
      (generally) only take back wielded ones, unless you've been really bad
    * By "take back" there are various different kinds of punishments
      you might receive.  Read artifact.c or playtest to find them.  =)

